<title>UK: Svenska sets perpetual U.S. dollar FRN.</title>
<headline>Svenska sets perpetual U.S. dollar FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SVENSKA HANDELSBANKEN</p>
<p> AMT    ***	     BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     *50 BP    PAY DATE    03.MAR.97</p>
<p> EXP MOODY  A1	  ISS PRICE  ***	 FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> EXP S&amp;P    A-	  REOFFER    ***	 LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO MARCH 2002, THEN STEPS UP TO 200 BP</p>
<p>	    **CALLABLE FROM MARCH 2002</p>
<p>	   ***PRICING AND SIZE TO BE ANNOUNCED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
